<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Qualitative Results</h2>

<figure id="A1.F5" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2603.10365v1/demo.png" id="A1.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:429/172;" width="429" height="172" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 5</span>: </span><span id="A1.F5.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Qualitative results.<span id="A1.F5.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Samples are generated by GAE (<math id="A1.F5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d=32" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d=32</annotation></semantics></math>) after 800 epochs of training. A Classifier-Free Guidance (CFG) scale of <math id="A1.F5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w=3.3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w=3.3</annotation></semantics></math> is utilized to enhance visual fidelity.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Extended Generative Performance Across Epochs</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, Tab. <a href="#A2.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ Appendix B Extended Generative Performance Across Epochs ‣ Geometric Autoencoder for Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> provides a detailed breakdown of the generative performance (gFID, without CFG) for GAE with various latent dimensions on the ImageNet <math id="A2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="256\times 256" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>256</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">256\times 256</annotation></semantics></math> benchmark across various training stages.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T9" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.T9.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 9</span>: </span><span id="A2.T9.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Detailed gFID scores without Classifier-Free Guidance for GAE with different latent dimension <math id="A2.T9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math> at different training epochs on ImageNet <math id="A2.T9.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="256\times 256" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>256</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">256\times 256</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></figcaption>
